Z||000000||85blackgt||05-30-2001||03:04 PM||||my front nose piece has a 2 inch crak that isint very visible can it be fixed? i do not want to put a brah on the front.||||reg||5
Z||000001||Monkeyman||05-30-2001||06:04 PM||||A plastic welder works wonders.  (Basically a stick of plastic and an industrial strength blow dryer.)  Just take it slow so you don't deform the Enduroflex.  Weld the back, then sand and repaint the front.<P>MM||||reg||1
Z||000002||mbramble||05-30-2001||06:26 PM||||Or you can buy some flexible bumper repair stuff at your local auto paint supply house.  It's a 2 part mix and does a great job.  I paid $30 for a tube that did two 8-10 inch long cracks and I still have about 1/2 the tube left.  Sands right down and you can't tell where the tears were.||||reg||1
